Extracting sequence information

seqkit fx2tab -j 6 -o assembly/qc/phased_hifiasm/TUE_02_03_hifiasm_ont/T2T_contigs.both.seqinfo.txt assembly/output/hifiasm/TUE_02_03_hifiasm_ont/assembly.fasta


Extracting 1000bps from start and end of sequences for telomere motif identification

seqkit subseq -w 0 -j 6 -r 1:1000/-1000:-1 assembly/output/hifiasm/TUE_02_03_hifiasm_ont/assembly.fasta >assembly/qc/phased_hifiasm/TUE_02_03_hifiasm_ont/T2T_contigs.both.teloinput.fa


searching telomere motif

tidk search -d . -f assembly/qc/phased_hifiasm/TUE_02_03_hifiasm_ont/T2T_contigs.both.teloinput.fa -o assembly/qc/phased_hifiasm/TUE_02_03_hifiasm_ont/T2T_contigs.both -s TTAGGG -w 1000


